        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "If it’s your turn, then yes, you can.",
        "question": "If this Digimon is in my battle area, can I digivolve it into a Digimon with “Green/Level 4” digivolution requirements?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't. Effects don't activate from breeding areas, so this Digimon isn't treated as green, and you can't digivolve it into a Digimon that requires a green level 4 Digimon.",
